hi-058-luxun:line040:m0012","start":12,"end":15,"surface":"公孫淵","kind":"person","person_id":"z0r_ri5_noq","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-058-luxun:line040","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-058-luxun"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-luxun:line041:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"淵","kind":"person","person_id":"z0r_ri5_noq","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-058-luxun:line041","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-058-luxun"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-luxun:line041:m0252","start":252,"end":253,"surface":"淵","kind":"person","person_id":"z0r_ri5_noq","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-058-luxun:line041","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-058-luxun"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-wu052-zz-main-14","person_id":"z0r_ri5_noq","title":"燕王","kind":"noble_rank","mode":"attestation","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-052","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangzhao-complete","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-052-zhangzhao-complete","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangzhao-complete:line022","quote":"權以公孫淵稱藩，遣張彌、許晏至遼東拜淵爲燕王。昭諫曰：\"淵背魏懼討，遠來求援，非本志也。若淵改圖，欲自明於魏，兩使不反，不亦取笑於天下乎?\"權與相反覆，昭意彌切。權不能堪，案刀而怒曰：\"呉國士人入宮則拜孤，出宮則拜君，孤之敬君，亦爲至矣，而數於眾中折孤，孤嘗恐失計。\"昭熟視權曰：\"臣雖知言不用，每竭愚忠者，誠以太后臨崩，呼老臣於床下，遺詔顧命之言故在耳。\"因涕泣橫流。權擲刀致地，與昭對泣。然卒遣彌、晏往。昭忿言之不用，稱疾不朝。權恨之，土塞其門，昭又於內以土封之。淵果殺彌，晏。權數慰謝昭，昭固不起，權因出過其門呼昭，昭辭疾篤。權燒其門，欲以恐之，昭更閉門戸。權使人滅火，住門良久，昭諸子共扶昭起，權載以還宮，深自克責。昭不得已，然後朝會。","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangzhao-complete:line022:m0002"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-wu052-zz-main-14:a","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangzhao-complete:line022","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"燕王","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangzhao-complete:line022:m0002","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},